Package: wifi-hotspot
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: hostapd, dnsmasq, iw, iproute2, iptables, pkexec
Maintainer: Antigravity <support@example.com>
Description: Rust Wi-Fi Hotspot for Linux (AP/STA Concurrent Mode)
 A lightweight native desktop GUI application that enables concurrent 
 Wi-Fi station and access point (hotspot) mode on Linux wireless cards.
